{"seq":2,"slug":"slots-and-render-functions","title":"插槽与渲染函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/slots-and-render-functions","wordCount":575,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"插槽与渲染函数\">插槽与渲染函数</h1><h2 id=\"内容分发机制\">内容分发机制</h2><p>Vue 的插槽（Slots）系统允许父组件向子组件传递模板内容，是构建灵活、可复用组件的核心机制。渲染函数（Render Functions）则提供了 JavaScript 层面的完全控制能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph SlotTypes[&quot;插槽类型&quot;]&#10;        DS[&quot;默认插槽&quot;]&#10;        NS[&quot;具名插槽&quot;]&#10;        SS[&quot;作用域插槽&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph RenderApproach[&quot;渲染方式&quot;]&#10;        T[&quot;Template(模板)&quot;]&#10;        H[&quot;h() 函数&quot;]&#10;        J[&quot;JSX&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph SlotTypes[\"插槽类型\"]\n        DS[\"默认插槽\"]\n        NS[\"具名插槽\"]\n        SS[\"作用域插槽\"]\n    end\n    subgraph RenderApproach[\"渲染方式\"]\n        T[\"Template(模板)\"]\n        H[\"h() 函数\"]\n        J[\"JSX\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>插槽（Slot）</strong>：父组件向子组件注入模板内容的出口，分默认插槽、具名插槽和作用域插槽三类。</li>\n<li><strong>作用域插槽</strong>：子组件把数据通过 slot props 交给父组件，实现渲染逻辑的「反向控制」。</li>\n<li><strong>渲染函数</strong>：用 <code>h()</code> 以 JavaScript 描述虚拟 DOM，比模板更灵活，适合动态性强的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>虚拟节点（VNode）</strong>：<code>h()</code> 的返回值，是模板与渲染函数共同的编译产物形态。</li>\n<li><strong>函数式组件</strong>：无状态、无实例的纯渲染组件，开销更小，适合纯展示。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"具名插槽\">具名插槽</h2><p>子组件通过 <code>&lt;slot name=&quot;xxx&quot;&gt;</code> 定义多个插槽出口，父组件通过 <code>v-slot:xxx</code> 或 <code>#xxx</code> 传递对应内容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 子组件 AppLayout.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;div class=&quot;layout&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;header&gt;&#10;      &lt;slot name=&quot;header&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/header&gt;&#10;    &lt;main&gt;&#10;      &lt;slot /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/main&gt;&#10;    &lt;footer&gt;&#10;      &lt;slot name=&quot;footer&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/footer&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 子组件 AppLayout.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;div class=\"layout\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;header></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;slot name=\"header\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/header></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;slot /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;footer></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;slot name=\"footer\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/footer></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 父组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;AppLayout&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #header&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;页面标题&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;这是默认插槽的内容&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;template #footer&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;版权所有 © 2026&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;  &lt;/AppLayout&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 父组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;AppLayout></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #header></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h1>页面标题&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;p>这是默认插槽的内容&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #footer></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p>版权所有 © 2026&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/AppLayout></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"作用域插槽\">作用域插槽</h2><p>作用域插槽允许子组件向插槽传递数据，让父组件自定义渲染逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 子组件 DataList.vue --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Item {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  status: &#39;active&#39; | &#39;inactive&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;defineProps&lt;{ items: Item[] }&gt;();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;li v-for=&quot;item in items&quot; :key=&quot;item.id&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;slot name=&quot;item&quot; :item=&quot;item&quot; :index=&quot;items.indexOf(item)&quot;&gt;&#10;        {{ item.name }}&#10;      &lt;/slot&gt;&#10;    &lt;/li&gt;&#10;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 子组件 DataList.vue --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Item {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  status: 'active' | 'inactive';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps&#x3C;{ items: Item[] }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;li v-for=\"item in items\" :key=\"item.id\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;slot name=\"item\" :item=\"item\" :index=\"items.indexOf(item)\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {{ item.name }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/slot></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 父组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;DataList :items=&quot;items&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;template #item=&quot;{ item, index }&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;span&gt;{{ index + 1 }}. {{ item.name }}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;      &lt;span :class=&quot;item.status&quot;&gt;{{ item.status }}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;    &lt;/template&gt;&#10;  &lt;/DataList&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 父组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;DataList :items=\"items\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;template #item=\"{ item, index }\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;span>{{ index + 1 }}. {{ item.name }}&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;span :class=\"item.status\">{{ item.status }}&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/DataList></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    C[&quot;子组件&quot;]&#10;    P[&quot;父组件&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; |&quot;slot props&lt;br/&gt;(item, index)&quot;| P&#10;    P --&gt; |&quot;自定义渲染&lt;br/&gt;template&quot;| C\">flowchart LR\n    C[\"子组件\"]\n    P[\"父组件\"]\n    C --&gt; |\"slot props&lt;br/&gt;(item, index)\"| P\n    P --&gt; |\"自定义渲染&lt;br/&gt;template\"| C</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型化插槽-3-3\">类型化插槽（3.3+）</h2><p>使用 <code>defineSlots</code> 为插槽提供类型约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;interface Item {&#10;  id: number;&#10;  name: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;defineProps&lt;{ items: Item[] }&gt;();&#10;&#10;defineSlots&lt;{&#10;  default(props: { items: Item[] }): void;&#10;  item(props: { item: Item; index: number }): void;&#10;  empty(): void;&#10;}&gt;();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Item {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps&#x3C;{ items: Item[] }>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineSlots&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  default(props: { items: Item[] }): void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  item(props: { item: Item; index: number }): void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  empty(): void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"h-渲染函数\">h() 渲染函数</h2><p><code>h()</code> 函数用于在 JavaScript 中创建虚拟 DOM 节点，提供比模板更灵活的控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { h, ref, defineComponent } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineComponent({&#10;  props: {&#10;    level: { type: Number, required: true, validator: (v: number) =&gt; v &gt;= 1 &amp;&amp; v &lt;= 6 },&#10;  },&#10;  setup(props, { slots }) {&#10;    return () =&gt; h(`h${props.level}`, { class: &#39;heading&#39; }, slots.default?.());&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { h, ref, defineComponent } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineComponent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  props: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    level: { type: Number, required: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">validator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">props</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">slots</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`h${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">level</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { class: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'heading'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, slots.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?.());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>常规 UI 组件</td>\n<td>Template</td>\n<td>直观、易读、编译优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态标签/层级</td>\n<td>h() 函数</td>\n<td>编程灵活性高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂条件渲染</td>\n<td>h() 函数</td>\n<td>避免模板中大量 v-if</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库/组件库开发</td>\n<td>h() 或 JSX</td>\n<td>更好的抽象能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"h-函数签名\">h() 函数签名</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function h(&#10;  type: string | Component,&#10;  props?: Record&lt;string, any&gt; | null,&#10;  children?: string | VNode | VNode[] | (() =&gt; VNode[]),&#10;): VNode;&#10;&#10;// 原生元素&#10;h(&#39;div&#39;, { class: &#39;container&#39; }, [h(&#39;h1&#39;, null, &#39;标题&#39;), h(&#39;p&#39;, null, &#39;内容&#39;)]);&#10;&#10;// 组件&#10;h(MyComponent, {&#10;  modelValue: value.value,&#10;  &#39;onUpdate:modelValue&#39;: (v: string) =&gt; {&#10;    value.value = v;&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  props</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VNode</span><span style=\"colo