dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">span</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Badge.props </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: { type: String, required: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  text: { type: String, default: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Badge</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>具名插槽</strong>通过 <code>name</code> 属性定义多个内容分发点，<code>#name</code> 缩写语法更简洁</li>\n<li><strong>作用域插槽</strong>允许子组件向父组件暴露数据，实现&quot;反向控制&quot;渲染</li>\n<li><code>defineSlots</code>（3.3+）为插槽提供 TypeScript 类型约束</li>\n<li><code>h()</code> 渲染函数提供完全的 JavaScript 编程能力，适合动态性强的场景</li>\n<li>JSX 在 Vue 中通过 <code>@vitejs/plugin-vue-jsx</code> 支持，兼具可读性和灵活性</li>\n<li><strong>函数式组件</strong>适合无状态的纯展示组件，开销更小</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"插槽与渲染函数","id":"插槽与渲染函数"},{"level":2,"text":"内容分发机制","id":"内容分发机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"具名插槽","id":"具名插槽"},{"level":2,"text":"作用域插槽","id":"作用域插槽"},{"level":2,"text":"类型化插槽（3.3+）","id":"类型化插槽-3-3"},{"level":2,"text":"h() 渲染函数","id":"h-渲染函数"},{"level":3,"text":"h() 函数签名","id":"h-函数签名"},{"level":2,"text":"JSX in Vue","id":"jsx-in-vue"},{"level":2,"text":"函数式组件","id":"函数式组件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Props 与事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/props-and-events"},"next":{"title":"动态组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/component-design/dynamic-components"}}